{
  "title": "Cheese Trentingrana Captioning Dataset",
  "id": "marcopanciera/cheese-trentingrana",
  "licenses": [
    {
      "name": "CC0-1.0"
    }
  ],
  "description": "Cleaned image-caption training data for Trentingrana cheese (AI4FQC project 07). Contains 2,273 BMP images (Fetta + Grana views), 38,437 (image, panelist, attribute, caption) training rows, and a 70/15/15 train/val/test split stratified by year. Captions cleaned from raw panelist Italian text via deterministic preprocessing + LLM rewrite + manual salvage. Companion code at github.com/panciut/Cheese."
}
